Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a35e182e-00e0-3016-86d4-bc8a1ca3cee5.xml</text>
